    "split": "Grouped by Juliet test case (all flow variants of one CWE/data-source/sink stay together), stratified by CWE; exact-duplicate and near-duplicate (TF-IDF cosine >= 0.95) validation/test samples against training were removed.",
    "ground_truth": "Function-level category labels from CWE directory + Juliet bad/good naming; detection is scored per category per function. Localisation is scored separately for rules only.",
    "model_selection": "Feature set, C and per-category thresholds were chosen on the validation split only.",
